Z||000015||StuGood||11-02-2000||10:25 PM||||Think we've milked this topic for all it's worth?  So here's a serious question - on a (car's) bra, what're the two little loopy flap-folded-over thingys for?  Sorry about the technical jargon...<P>Had to ask it here... Never had the gumption to walk up to a lady and ask what the loopy things in her bra were!||||reg||5
